abstract: "Analysis platform for the FORMIS ant-literature database — converts the ~80,000-record BibTeX export to JSON, then builds publication-trend and co-authorship visualizations plus LLM summaries, translations and podcasts via NotebookLM, OpenAI and Perplexity."
